note The search, run when the search field submits: the regex is compiled before the previous hits are dropped, so a typo keeps the last hit list and only reports; the scan is over the lines already in memory, in file order, and the status line gives the count. One hit past HIT_LIMIT is collected to know whether there were more; the list is then truncated to the limit and hits_shown set to First, or All when everything fit.
